 ],
 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "In this town\u2026 your",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 1.82,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "shadow clocks out at",
   "start": 1.82,
   "end": 3.508,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "nine P.M.",
   "start": 3.508,
   "end": 4.268,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Every night, when the",
   "start": 5.068,
   "end": 6.597,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "clock tower strikes nine\u2026",
   "start": 6.597,
   "end": 8.417,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "every shadow peels off",
   "start": 8.717,
   "end": 10.566,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "the ground\u2026",
   "start": 10.566,
   "end": 11.491,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "and walks to the",
   "start": 11.791,
   "end": 12.95,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "old factory. For the",
   "start": 12.95,
   "end": 14.399,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "night shift.",
   "start": 14.399,
   "end": 15.268,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "At sunrise, they come",
   "start": 16.568,
   "end": 18.532,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "back.",
   "start": 18.532,
   "end": 19.0,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody knows what they",
   "start": 19.3,
   "end": 21.145,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "do there. Nobody asks.",
   "start": 21.145,
   "end": 22.991,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Theo was twelve. He",
   "start": 23.791,
   "end": 25.128,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "had watched it every",
   "start": 25.128,
   "end": 26.535,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "night of his life.",
   "start": 26.535,
   "end": 27.801,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Goodnight, shadow.",
   "start": 28.301,
   "end": 29.56,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "And every night\u2026 his",
   "start": 29.86,
   "end": 31.443,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "shadow waved back.",
   "start": 31.443,
   "end": 32.868,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "But one morning\u2026",
   "start": 34.168,
   "end": 35.555,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Theo's shadow didn't come",
   "start": 35.955,
   "end": 38.141,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "back.",
   "start": 38.141,
   "end": 38.579,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Theo\u2026 where is your",
   "start": 39.979,
   "end": 41.163,
   "spk": "MO"
  },
  {
   "text": "shadow?",
   "start": 41.163,
   "end": 41.6,
   "spk": "MO"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody can know. Do",
   "start": 41.9,
   "end": 43.161,
   "spk": "MO"
  },
  {
   "text": "you understand me? Nobody.",
   "start": 43.161,
   "end": 44.887,
   "spk": "MO"
  },
  {
   "text": "Because in this town\u2026",
   "start": 45.287,
   "end": 46.767,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "people without a shadow\u2026",
   "start": 46.767,
   "end": 48.46,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "start to fade.",
   "start": 48.46,
   "end": 49.447,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then I'm going to",
   "start": 50.947,
   "end": 52.136,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "find it.",
   "start": 52.136,
   "end": 52.696,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "That night, at nine\u2026",
   "start": 53.096,
   "end": 54.535,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Theo did the one",
   "start": 54.535,
   "end": 55.686,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "thing nobody ever does.",
   "start": 55.686,
   "end": 57.341,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "He followed the shadows.",
   "start": 57.641,
   "end": 59.711,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Inside the old factory\u2026",
   "start": 61.011,
   "end": 62.626,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "the shadows were building",
   "start": 62.626,
   "end": 64.383,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "something.",
   "start": 64.383,
   "end": 65.085,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "We're one short tonight.",
   "start": 65.585,
   "end": 67.205,
   "spk": "F"
  },
  {
   "text": "Without him\u2026 it won't",
   "start": 67.505,
   "end": 68.851,
   "spk": "F"
  },
  {
   "text": "be finished by morning.",
   "start": 68.851,
   "end": 70.326,
   "spk": "F"
  },
  {
   "text": "It was a sunrise.",
   "start": 70.726,
   "end": 71.985,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "The shadows were building\u2026",
   "start": 71.985,
   "end": 73.912,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "the sunrise.",
   "start": 73.912,
   "end": 74.801,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Wait. Someone's watching.",
   "start": 75.901,
   "end": 77.569,
   "spk": "F"
  },
  {
   "text": "Theo ran.",
   "start": 77.769,
   "end": 79.006,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Back home, his closet",
   "start": 81.901,
   "end": 83.769,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "door was open.",
   "start": 83.769,
   "end": 85.015,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And inside\u2026 shaking\u2026 was",
   "start": 85.415,
   "end": 87.542,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "his own shadow.",
   "start": 87.542,
   "end": 88.871,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "\u2026You?",
   "start": 89.271,
   "end": 90.103,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "It pressed a finger",
   "start": 90.703,
   "end": 92.049,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "to its lips. And",
   "start": 92.049,
   "end": 93.183,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "wrote on the wall\u2026",
   "start": 93.183,
   "end": 94.458,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Outside, the clock tower",
   "start": 97.558,
   "end": 99.509,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "started striking nine. Again.",
   "start": 99.509,
   "end": 101.867,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "But it was only",
   "start": 102.267,
   "end": 103.521,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "midnight.",
   "start": 103.521,
   "end": 104.273,
   "spk": "N"
  }
 ],
